     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It&#39;s probably the WebSocket connection getting hung up in the Apache layer--most Apache configurations aren&#39;t set up to proxy WebSockets. Try adding the directive &quot;disable_websockets;&quot; to your /etc/shiny-server/shiny-server.conf file.</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
