     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I had already disabled the websocket protocol.  Reconfiguring Apache to support passing websockets to shiny fixed everything.  Thanks.</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Aug 8, 2016 at 1:27 PM, Joe Cheng <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@rstudio.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
