   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sounds good. But just so you know, if some network configuration causes websockets to fail, the SockJS library we use will fall back to more traditional connection methods, which will probably exhibit the slowness you were seeing. If you care about that, I&#39;d play with your Apache mod_proxy buffer size, probably a small buffer size will help here; or perhaps easier to add this configuration directive to Shiny Server: &quot;disable_protocols xdr-streaming xhr-streaming;&quot;</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Aug 8, 2016 at 11:40 AM Will Gray &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gra...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I had already disabled the websocket protocol.  Reconfiguring Apache to support passing websockets to shiny fixed everything.  Thanks.</div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Aug 8, 2016 at 1:27 PM, Joe Cheng <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@rstudio.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">It&#39;s probably the WebSocket connection getting hung up in the Apache layer--most Apache configurations aren&#39;t set up to proxy WebSockets. Try adding the directive &quot;disable_websockets;&quot; to your /etc/shiny-server/shiny-server.conf file.</div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Aug 8, 2016 at 11:25 AM Will Gray &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gra...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
